 1BF0   0026            '----- closing narration
 1BF0   0026            PRINT "You run swiftly from the flaming"
 1BF0   0026            PRINT "building that is being consumed by"
 1BF0   0026            PRINT "the blaze. As you look back at the"
 1BF0   0026            PRINT "burning house, spewing fiery shrapnel"
 1BF0   0026            PRINT "about the grounds you wonder about"
 1BF0   0026            PRINT "your uncle and his work. What was"
 1BF0   0026            PRINT "he realy like? What was obliterated"
 1BF0   0026            PRINT "in the house? Did you leave something"
 1BF0   0026            PRINT "behind or undone ...."
 1BF0   0026            PRINT "Maybe some day you'll find out."
 1BF0   0026            PRINT "": PRINT "Press a key to exit."
